  m_text: "\u2014 HOW TO PLAY \u2014 : Battle your way through randomized combat
    zones. Watch your Health and Open chests to discover powerful Cards. Equip matching
    decks to unlock powerful Set Bonuses. Find Campfires in Respite zones to restore
    your health before the next battle. \u2022 PROGRESS: Clear all enemies in a zone
